===Etymology 1===
American variant of [[holla]], [[hallo]] or [[hollo]].

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[yell]], [[shout]].
#: {{ux|en|I heard a '''holler''' from over the fence.}}
# {{lb|en|by extension|colloquial}} Any communication to get somebody's attention.
#: {{ux|en|If you need anything, just give me a '''holler'''.}}
# {{lb|en|music}} A [[field holler]].

